# This repo targets Linux hosts (shell scripts, YAML, Ansible, Jinja2
# templates) even though it's often developed from a Windows checkout. CRLF
# line endings break shebang execution and heredocs on the Linux side, so
# normalize all text files to LF on checkout and in the repository,
# regardless of the platform or the user's local core.autocrlf setting.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicitly binary — never touched for line endings or diffed as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.p12 binary
*.pfx binary
*.der binary
